Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.75,0:00:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Free?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.85,0:00:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna! Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.41,0:00:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.17,0:00:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna! Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.41,0:00:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Xenon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.81,0:00:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.97,0:00:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.45,0:00:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, it's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's mine, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.49,0:00:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.11,0:00:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.37,0:01:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.33,0:01:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.85,0:01:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.15,0:01:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even see the needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take a look, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, I'm not gonna\Nlet you die like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.39,0:02:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, hey, you got this\Nweird thing on your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me that's where\Nyou hit me with the needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.85,0:02:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like it, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one of the electrodes from this\Nheart monitor I was hooked up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heart monitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you scared the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.37,0:02:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I scared you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.49,0:02:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you think I feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were gonna\Ndie just now, you dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.45,0:02:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not dead, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.27,0:02:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's still got a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crazy, but thank\Nyou for coming over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.35,0:03:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thank you for\Nclocking him when you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't get here sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.15,0:03:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
