Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see the look on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time you want to meet, be on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girl, you've been acting\Nway too cocky lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No you guys it's cool we're\Nall friends here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.05,0:04:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.99,0:04:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They come in real handy,\Nespecially when you need a loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of, I need 20k, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.59,0:04:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you before, I'm not\Nlending you guys any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll change your mind after I\Nshow you what my brother gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.37,0:04:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get this, he told me not to point\Nthis at anyone, but what does he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you've seen one before,\Nso it doesn't bug you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or does it, Asada?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get on your knees and say you're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, it's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Government M-1911.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your brother has good taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.19,0:05:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not really my style, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.65,0:05:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for future reference, it\Nonly fires when the safety's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.77,0:06:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your brother's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.59,0:06:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't point this at people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.65,0:06:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.91,0:06:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up, Endo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.27,0:06:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say the first step's\Nalways the hardest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.57,0:06:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Asada!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he your boyfriend?
