Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.11,0:07:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.02,0:07:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I said I'd meet you, I didn't think\Nyou'd part yourself in front of my school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Sinon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyoji Shinkawa and his older\Nbrother Shoichi were arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the interrogation, it came\Nout that another person was involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This third death gun, Atsushi\NKanamoto, is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.81,0:07:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Kikuoka says they'll\Ncatch him soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.91,0:07:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got the idea of creating\Nthe Death Gun character when
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.13,0:07:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoichi got the invisibility\Ncloak through a real-money trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using the cloak and some binoculars,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoichi started stealing the\Nreal-world info of the other players.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, his little brother Kyouji was\Nhaving issues with his avatar, Spiegel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These players who think it's\Nall about their agility?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.41,0:08:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, they're living in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiegel was an AGI type, which\NZexine used to recommend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Zexine shifted his stats to an\NSTR-VIT combo, and that pissed Kyoji off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.45,0:08:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Shoichi found out, he gave\NKyoji Zexine's name and address IRL.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, they started talking\Nabout how to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say they weren't\Nserious about it at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But day after day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.65,0:08:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the more they talked about it, the more\Nit seemed they could get away with it.
