Dialogue: 3,0:08:47.44,0:08:47.48,Door,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\2c&HD3D8D6&\fscx51.13\fscy51.13\pos(1187.86,581.39)}Keep \NClosed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.81,0:08:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They researched their victims carefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,narrowing the list down to the ones who\Nlived alone in low-security apartments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using the key card, Shouichi broke\Ninto their first victim's place,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigemura, a .k .a. Zekseed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The brothers worked out the exact\Ntime he was supposed to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.39,0:09:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when Kyoji logged in as his\Nbrother's avatar Sterben
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and announced himself as\NDeath Gun and shot Zexit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.01,0:09:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their second victim, Usushio\NTarako, was killed the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.15,0:09:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But instead of being scared of Death Gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.61,0:09:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the other players in GGO treated\Nit like some kind of joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.53,0:09:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoichi and his partners were furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they decided to kill some\Nplayers during the B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,final.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.83,0:09:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They found three who met the same\Ncriteria as Zexit and Tarako,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.15,0:09:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hailrider, Garrett, and Sinon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing three people was going to make\Nthings hard for just the two of them, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be in sync with Death Gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.17,0:09:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the person doing the\Nreal-world killing had to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:09:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make sure they'd be at each\Ntarget's house on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.85,0:10:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they recruited that Kanamoto guy you\Ntold me about to be the third Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd they find him, though? Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kanamoto was an old friend of Shoichi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.29,0:10:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were both part of\NLaughing Coffin and SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.45,0:10:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found out his handle\Nthere was Johnny Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he worked with Zaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.17,0:10:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think his weapon of\Nchoice was a poison knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They put Kanamoto on Pale Rider and\NGarrett, because he lived nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon, on the other hand, was Kyoji's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, Shoichi was the one\Nwho usually did the killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.81,0:10:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for this one job, Kyoji\Ninsisted on being the one to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.19,0:10:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, is that what he wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Shinka, I mean, Kyoji, say that? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His brother was the one who gave\Nus all the details of their plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.51,0:10:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyoji still refuses to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.77,0:10:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of, we found out a\Nlittle more about Shoichi.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.23,0:11:04.95,Android,,0,0,0,,{\p1\c&HF0F0F0&\alpha&H40&\pos(2622,40.5)\an9\blur1.2}m -750 0 l 0 0 l 0 832.5 l -750 832.5
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.23,0:11:04.95,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H272728&\b1\fs28.5\an7\pos(1288.5,52.5)}Written Record of Oral Testimony
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.23,0:11:04.95,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H272728&\fs28.5\an7\pos(1152,93)}Permanent Address\NCurrent Address\N\N\NOccupation\NFull Name\NBirth Date
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.23,0:11:04.95,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H272728&\fs28.5\an7\pos(1425,93)}3-45 Hongou, Bunkyo Ward, Tokyo\NLima Heights, 3-40-403 Koishikawa, \NBunkyo Ward, Tokyo\NUnemployed\NShinkawa Shouichi\N11/13/2006 (19 years old)
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.23,0:11:04.95,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H272728&\fs28.5\an7\pos(1152,285)}In regards to the alleged homicide pertaining to the person \Nstated above, on December 15, 2025, at the Metropolitan \NPolice Department's Motofuji Police Station, after I informed \Nthe suspect in advance of his right to remain silent, he \Nwillingly offered the following testimony.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.23,0:11:04.95,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H272728&\fs28.5\an7\pos(1152,450)}1
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.23,0:11:04.95,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H272728&\fs28.5\an7\pos(1200,450)}I live alone at the address that I provided to you earlier.\NI'm unemployed and primarily make do off of the \Nallowance given to me by my father. He provides me with\N500,000 yen per month for living expenses. I also have\N income from {\i1}Gun Gale Online's{\i0} game coin conversion\N system.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.23,0:11:04.95,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H272728&\fs28.5\an7\pos(1152,637.5)}2
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.23,0:11:04.95,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H272728&\fs28.5\an7\pos(1200,637.5)}I was born the oldest son of the owner and director of a \Ngeneral hospital, and because of my chronic poor health,\N I was repeatedly in and out of the hospital up until I\N graduated middle school. As a result, I fell behind in my \Nstudies, failed my entrance exams, and was to enter high\Nschool a year late. Though it seemed my father had \Nintended for me to succeed him, it became apparent he \Nhad given up on me{\alpha&H60&}...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:10:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Health-wise, he'd been\Nsickly since childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.37,0:11:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His father pretty much gave up on him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.73,0:11:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he decided early on to hand\Nthe hospital over to Kyoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Staying sharp, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.61,0:11:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Locked and loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, the brothers seemed\Nto be close growing up.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.42,0:11:20.88,Android,,0,0,0,,{\p1\c&HF0F0F0&\alpha&H40&\pos(2622,40.5)\an9\blur1.2}m -750 0 l 0 0 l 0 840 l -750 840
Dialogue: 2,0:11:10.42,0:11:20.88,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H272728&\fs28.5\an7\pos(1200,52.5)}and so he pinned his hopes in my brother, Kyouji, who\Nwas three years younger. My father arranged for Kyouji to \Nhave a personal tutor since elementary school, and there \Nwere times my father taught Kyouji himself.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:10.42,0:11:20.88,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H272728&\fs28.5\an7\pos(1152,187.5)}3
Dialogue: 2,0:11:10.42,0:11:20.88,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H272728&\fs28.5\an7\pos(1200,187.5)}I dropped out of high school, and that was when I got\N obsessed with MMORPGs. Around then, or three years ago \Nto be exact, I was playing {\i1}Sword Art Online{\i0}, which had\N become a social phenomenon. In the game, I was in a\N guild of murderers known as "Laughing Coffin". The guild \Nwas formed on New Year's Day in 2024, and we referred\N to ourselves as a "red guild"—a reference to the orange \Ncursors that marked criminals in the game—as we went \Naround PKing on a daily basis, fully aware of the fact that a \N"game over", or death in-game would be the end of that \Nperson in the real world. Around summertime that year, \NLaughing Coffin was pushed to the brink of annihilation by \Na punitive force composed of players of the "clearing \Ngroup", who were known for fighting on the game's front \Nlines. In the end, I was captured and ended up jailed \Nwithin a prison in the game world. The humiliation I \Nsuffered then motivated me to spend day after day \Npracticing techniques called "Sword Skills". Some time \Nlater, {\i1}Sword Art Online{\i0} was cleared and I returned to the \Nreal world as one of the so-called "SAO survivors". After \Nreturning to the real world, I tried to leave my time in\N{\i1}Sword Art Online{\i0} behind me, but during rehab at the \Nhospital{\alpha&H60&}... {\alpha&H00&}I told only Kyouji about what I experienced{\alpha&H60&}...{\alpha&H00&}\Nblood on my hands{\alpha&H60&}...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then Shouichi got\Nobsessed with MMORPGs,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in 2022, he got trapped\Nin Sword Art Online.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After he got out, Shouichi\Nonly spoke to Kyouji about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He bragged about how in that\Nworld he was a real mass murderer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and how he was feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Kyoji's eyes, his\Nbig brother was a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for Shouichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.55,0:11:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's sticking with the story that\Neverything about the Death Gun concept,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.87,0:11:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including the murders,\Nwas just part of a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That his actions here, like\Ngathering intel on victims,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prepping for the murders, and committing\Nthem, were no different than an SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dark side of VR Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.43,0:11:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his reality got a lot less real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:12:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how are you handling yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I left a\Npart of me back in SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So right now, there's less of\Nme here than there was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.91,0:12:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to go back? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.77,0:12:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you ask me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kind of contradicting\Nwhat you told me the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said there's no such thing\Nas a virtual world, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.67,0:12:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That like, wherever you\Nwere, that's your reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where I am right now, here,\Nthis world is my reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if you told me this was a virtual\Nworld, it would still be reality to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.73,0:12:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta hand it to you, Sinon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you said just now might be the only\Ngood thing to come out of this nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, put a sock in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.93,0:12:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm with Kirito on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I told you pretty much\Nall we've found out so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have any questions before I go? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.99,0:13:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has there been any word on what's\Ngoing to happen to Kyoji yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.97,0:13:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on his brother's\Nconfession and their behavior,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll most likely be sent\Nto a medical detention center.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.53,0:13:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt either one knows\Nwhat reality is anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.31,0:13:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything\Nabout Kyochi's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've known Kyochi a long time and,\Nwell, I think his reality was Aincrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.53,0:13:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd pretty much given up on this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.91,0:13:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was nothing left for him other\Nthan GGO, so he made that his reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd spend hours in it, grinding away,\Nboosting his XP and trying to be the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.47,0:13:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the stress got\Nto be too much for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From playing a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you can lose track\Nof time, but reality? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:14:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At some point, Kyoji just swapped\Nout one for the other, his real life,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for his virtual one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I wish I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, why do you think he did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.95,0:14:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.49,0:14:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.03,0:14:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I was the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.15,0:14:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes down to it, maybe\Nall us VRMMO players are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we want is to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.33,0:14:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikwoka, I'd like to go see\Nhim if that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.29,0:14:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so much I want to tell him,\Nlike what we were just talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And other stuff I've been\Nthinking, if it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a strong person to want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.41,0:14:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I, for one, think it's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.85,0:14:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't have visitors yet, but\Nwhen he can, I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have to get\Nback to the office now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for taking the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.33,0:14:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you for talking to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.53,0:14:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:15:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys risked your lives, and\NGod knows how many you saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the least I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, Kirito,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun, or Shoichi Shinkawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.19,0:15:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or Red-Eyed Zaza, or whatever you want to\Ncall him, asked me to give you a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to hear it,\Nsay the word and I'll tear it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.27,0:15:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wrote,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think this is over, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have what it takes to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, you'll realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.23,0:15:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.11,0:15:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.45,0:15:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Sinon? Hmm? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you free right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, free?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Free for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this is where you're taking me? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.79,0:16:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's someone inside I want you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.29,0:16:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made us wait so darn long, I wouldn't\Nhave had two slices of apple pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.19,0:16:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I get fat, it's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.11,0:16:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that my fault? Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.23,0:16:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to introduce us or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.45,0:16:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Shino Asada, a .k .a. Sinon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gun Gale Online's third champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are my friends from my time in SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rika, a .k .a.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liz, Blacksmith and Swindler. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.49,0:16:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's Asuna, the berserk healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.93,0:16:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real name, Asuna Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.53,0:16:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Berserk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to grab a seat\Nand get something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.01,0:17:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what Star...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, sterben means?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A term hospitals use for death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was he thinking, giving\Nhis avatar a name like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.85,0:17:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.87,0:17:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't try to find some deeper\Nmeaning in the name he gave his avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.17,0:17:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of times it boils down to\Nwhatever a player thinks sounds cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole time I thought\Nyou gave your avatar
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your name because you lacked imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zip it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.31,0:17:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do so have imagination. Lots\Nof it! Okay, geez. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anyway, I'm super stoked you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always cool to meet\Nanother girl VRMMO player.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.05,0:17:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we can be great friends, Asura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:17:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Asura. Shino.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:18:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's another reason for us\Nasking you to come here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.15,0:18:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon, I'm sorry to put\Nyou on the spot like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.53,0:18:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, uh, I told Asuna and Liz about what\Nhappened to you when you were younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.21,0:18:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I needed their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wanted to help you, so we paid a\Nvisit to the town where you used to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.99,0:18:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Sinon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.37,0:18:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They found someone who wants to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.87,0:18:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let you leave till you\Nhear what they have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.89,0:18:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might hurt, and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't stand by if there's\Na chance what they say helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.15,0:18:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do they want to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sari, do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sachi Osawa, you're\NShino Asada, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to introduce you to my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name's Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.45,0:19:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's four years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.13,0:19:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.51,0:19:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I used to work at the post office.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.95,0:19:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.15,0:19:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have done this ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.53,0:19:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry it took this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never apologized or\Nthanked you for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was pregnant with her the day that\Nman came in and tried to rob us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.27,0:20:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you did, it wasn't\Njust my life you saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved the life of my little girl, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.35,0:20:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you,\Nshe wouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.53,0:20:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saved your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon, time to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been blaming yourself way too long,\NBeating yourself up over what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.59,0:20:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying you're\Nwrong to do that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, whatever guilt\Nyou feel about what you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you got a right to consider\Nthe lives you saved, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got the right to think about\Nthose people and forgive yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.55,0:20:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted you to know.
